  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table id=\"Lama-Spoiler-1\" style=\"background-color: #D9D9FF; background-color: rgba(50, 50, 255, 0.2); text-align: center; padding: 5px; border: 1px #4A4ABA solid; margin: 10px auto; box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px; border-radius: 10px; width: 90%; line-height: 1.1\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Lamannia.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Lamannia.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><i>This page is based on information gathered on the</i> <b><a href=\"/page/Lamannia\" title=\"Lamannia\">Lamannia</a> preview server</b><br /><small><p style=\"font-size: 10px; line-height: 2px; margin: 0px;\"><b>Note:</b> Anything found on Lamannia is considered to be <a href=\"/page/Category:Speculation\" title=\"Category:Speculation\">Speculation</a> until it goes live.</p></small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Lamannia.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Lamannia.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Please <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ddowiki.com/index.php?title=Item:Epic_Wand_Bracelet&amp;action=edit#editform\"><span class=\"edit-link\" style=\"display: inherit;\" title=\"fix this page\">fix this page</span></a></span> if you know any information on this page to be in error.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://help.standingstonegames.com/hc/en-us/requests/new?ticket_form_id=438007\">Report Lamannia bugs to the developers!</a></span></td></tr><tr><td><small>Please <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ddowiki.com/index.php?title=Item:Epic_Wand_Bracelet&amp;action=edit#editform\"><span class=\"edit-link\" style=\"display: inherit;\" title=\"edit this page\">edit this page</span></a></span> to remove <code>&#123;&#123;&#32;<a href=\"/page/Template:Lamannia\" title=\"Template:Lamannia\">Lamannia</a>&#32;&#125;&#125;</code> if you can verify the information is correct.</small></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Wrist_items\" title=\"Category:Wrist items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Wrist.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Epic_Wand_Bracelet\">Epic Wand Bracelet</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #FFBBBB solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#FFBBBB;--bg-color-1-dark:#573F3F;--bg-color-2:#FFE4E1;--bg-color-2-dark:#3D2C2A;--header-color:#FFBBBB;--header-color-dark:#573F3F;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\">20\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:QuestionOrb.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/QuestionOrb.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Jewelry / Bracers\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Wrist\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">120\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a>:</b> <b>Leather</b> armor is made of the hide of animals. It provides decent protection without excessively restricting the user's movements.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">17\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0012008000</span>12,008<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Wrist Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Wrist Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Wand_Bracelet.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Wand_Bracelet.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"215\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A special bracelet that can store wands and scrolls. It will take on the properties of an item you fuse with it, and allow you to activate similar abilities daily.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>The wand bracelet was going to be in Update 12, but was pulled out at the last minute for unknown reasons (<span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forums-old.ddo.com/forums/showthread.php?p=4186074#post4186074\">DDO Forums</a></span>&#160;<sup id=\"old&#95;forums&#95;link&#95;2\" style=\"background-color: #FFAAAA;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/save/https%3A%2F%2Fforums-old.ddo.com%2Fforums%2Fshowthread.php%3Fp%3D4186074%23post4186074\"><abbr title=\"The old forums this link points to were shut down on August 31st, 2025. If this is important, please consider revising the template call as described at &#91;&#91;Template:Forums&#93;&#93;.\" style=\"display: initial;\">ARCHIVE ME!</abbr></a></sup>)\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817043252\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.110 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3215/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25572/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4672/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursi